    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Allistair
    Text: The castle has been on lockdown. No one gets in and no one gets out. The
      head priest arrived last night to try to control the situation and best guide
      us on what to do.
